dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40" id="ag-senders" placeholder="acme.io, pat@example.com" value=""/><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Addresses or domains. Leave empty for everyone who passes the rule above.</p></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><label for="ag-limit" class="text-[13px]">Replies per day at most</label><input type="number" data-slot="input" class="h-8 min-w-0 rounded-md border border-transparent bg-input px-2.5 py-1 text-base transition-colors outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-6 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:bg-background focus-visible:border-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 w-24" id="ag-limit" min="1" max="200" value="20"/></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">It always skips newsletters, no-reply addresses, automatic replies and mail older than a day, and answers a thread at most twice.</p></div></div><div class="min-w-0 space-y-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><label for="ag-inst" class="text-sm font-medium">Instructions</label><span class="flex gap-1"><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">Scheduling</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">Support inbox</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">Triage only</button></span></div><textarea data-slot="textarea" class="flex field-sizing-content w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-input px-2.5 py-2 text-base transition-colors outline-none placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:bg-background disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 min-h-64" id="ag-inst" rows="14" maxLength="4000" placeholder="Say what it is for, what it may answer, what it must never do, and when to leave a thread for you."></textarea><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><p>Write it like a note to a new assistant. It sees your instructions and the email, nothing else, and treats the email as untrusted text.</p><span class="shrink-0 tnum">0 / 4000</span></div><div class="space-y-2 rounded-lg bg-muted/50 p-3"><div class="text-sm font-medium">Try it</div><textarea data-slot="textarea" class="flex field-sizing-content min-h-16 w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent px-2.5 py-2 text-base transition-colors outline-none placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:bg-background disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 bg-background" rows="2" maxLength="2000" aria-label="Sample email" placeholder="Paste a sample email">Hi, I can’t sign in since this morning. Can you help?</textarea><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><button data-slot="button" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border bg-clip-padding 