exports[`Editor dialog > renders dialog for editing an existing agent with prefilled data 1`] = `"<div data-slot="dialog-content" class="max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto sm:max-w-4xl"><div data-slot="dialog-header"><h2 data-slot="dialog-title">Edit agent</h2><p data-slot="dialog-description">It reads new mail in the mailboxes you choose and follows your instructions. It only ever replies to the person who wrote.</p></div><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.35fr)]"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 md:border-r md:border-border md:pr-6"><div class="space-y-1.5"><label for="ag-name" class="text-sm font-medium">Name</label><input data-slot="input" class="h-8 w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border border-transparent bg-input px-2.5 py-1 text-base transition-colors outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-6 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:bg-background focus-visible:border-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40" id="ag-name" placeholder="Scheduling assistant" maxLength="60" value="Support Bot"/></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="text-sm font-medium">Mailboxes it watches</div><div class="flex max-h-36 flex-wrap gap-1.5 overflow-y-auto"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="max-w-full truncate rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors border-foreground bg-foreground text-background">maya@gmail.test</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="max-w-full truncate rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors border-border text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">maya@chen.studio</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="max-w-full truncate rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors border-border text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">maya@outlook.test</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="max-w-full truncate rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors border-border text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">hello@chen.studio</button></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><div class="text-sm font-medium">What it does with a reply</div><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border p-3 transition-colors border-foreground"><input type="radio" class="mt-1 accent-foreground" name="ag-mode" checked=""/><span><span class="block text-sm font-medium">Write a draft for me to review</span><span class="block text-xs text-muted-foreground">Recommended. The reply waits in Drafts and in your notifications until you send it.</span></span></label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border p-3 transition-colors border-border hover:bg-muted/40"><input type="radio" class="mt-1 accent-foreground" name="ag-mode"/><span><span class="block text-sm font-medium">Send replies by itself</span><span class="block text-xs text-muted-foreground">Replies go out from your address without you seeing them first, marked as automatic.</span></span></label></div><div class="space-y-3 rounded-lg border border-border p-3"><div class="text-sm font-medium">Which mail</div><label class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[13px]"><span>Only people I have screened in</span><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" data-state="checked" value="on" data-slot="switch" data-size="default" class="peer group/switch relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-transparent transition-all outline-none group-has-focus-visible/field-label:border-transparent group-has-focus-visible/field-label:ring-0 after:absolute after:-inset-x-3 after:-inset-y-2 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 data-[size=default]:h-[18.4px] data-[size=default]:w-[32px] data-[size=sm]:h-[14px] data-[size=sm]:w-[24px] dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 data-checked:bg-primary data-unchecked:bg-input dark:data-unchecked:bg-input/80 data-disabled:cursor-not-allowed data-disabled:opacity-50"><span data-state="checked" data-slot="switch-thumb" class="pointer-events-none block rounded-full bg-background ring-0 transition-transform group-data-[size=default]/switch:size-4 group-data-[size=sm]/switch:size-3 group-data-[size=default]/switch:data-checked:translate-x-[calc(100%-2px)] group-data-[size=sm]/switch:data-checked:translate-x-[calc(100%-2px)] dark:data-checked:bg-primary-foreground group-data-[size=default]/switch:data-unchecked:translate-x-0 group-data-[size=sm]/switch:data-unchecked:translate-x-0 dark:data-unchecked:bg-foreground"></span></button><input type="checkbox" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" style="position:absolute;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;margin:0;transform:translateX(-100%)" checked="" value="on"/></label><div class="space-y-1.5"><label for="ag-senders" class="text-[13px]">Only these senders <span class="text-muted-foreground">· optional</span></label><input data-slot="input" class="h-8 w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border border-transparent bg-input px-2.5 py-1 text-base transition-colors outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-6 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:bg-background focus-visible:border-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40" id="ag-senders" placeholder="acme.io, pat@example.com" value=""/><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Addresses or domains. Leave empty for everyone who passes the rule above.</p></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><label for="ag-limit" class="text-[13px]">Replies per day at most</label><input type="number" data-slot="input" class="h-8 min-w-0 rounded-md border border-transparent bg-input px-2.5 py-1 text-base transition-colors outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-6 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:bg-background focus-visible:border-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 w-24" id="ag-limit" min="1" max="200" value="20"/></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">It always skips newsletters, no-reply addresses, automatic replies and mail older than a day, and answers a thread at most twice.</p></div></div><div class="min-w-0 space-y-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><label for="ag-inst" class="text-sm font-medium">Instructions</label><span class="flex gap-1"><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">Scheduling</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">Support inbox</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-border px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 hover:text-foreground">Triage only</button></span></div><textarea data-slot="textarea" class="flex field-sizing-content w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-input px-2.5 py-2 text-base transition-colors outline-none placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:bg-background disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 min-h-64" id="ag-inst" rows="14" maxLength="4000" placeholder="Say what it is for, what it may answer, what it must never do, and when to leave a thread for you.">Answer politely and briefly.</textarea><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><p>Write it like a note to a new assistant. It sees your instructions and the email, nothing else, and treats the email as untrusted text.</p><span class="shrink-0 tnum">28 / 4000</span></div><div class="space-y-2 rounded-lg bg-muted/50 p-3"><div class="text-sm font-medium">Try it</div><textarea data-slot="textarea" class="flex field-sizing-content min-h-16 w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent px-2.5 py-2 text-base transition-colors outline-none placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:bg-background disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-input/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 md:text-sm dark:bg-input dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 bg-background" rows="2" maxLength="2000" aria-label="Sample email" placeholder="Paste a sample email">Hi, I can’t sign in since this morning. Can you help?</textarea><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><button data-slot="button" data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border bg-cl